  baseline "measured on 2026-09-16 by `cargo run --example measure_capability_routing` over data/benchmarks/capability-routing/. The starting run, recorded in plan 14's wave I9 report before plan 10 leaves 9-17 landed, was 0 of 420 passing: every case ended in the honest `Ask` because the seven frontier intents had no rows and no act or locus wiring. The three measures whose values below carry no placeholder note are that example's output; the rest are still the plan's declared targets and say so."
  placeholder_note "Every value written here in wave T is the plan's declared target, not a measurement. Writing a measured-looking number that no run produced is what plan 00 section 6.2 forbids, so each placeholder says so in its own note and the tests that read this file stay red until leaf 1 lands."
